# HabitMeasure — Cursor Rules v4.0

## PROJECT
Marketing landing page + Lab for HabitMeasure — a habit timer app.
Tagline: "Kleine gewoontes. Grote verandering. Jij meet het."
Goal: Capture waitlist emails + Beta tester lab access.
Audience: People (28–45) who want to build healthy habits and track progress.
Live: habitmeasure.com
Local: C:\Users\djdeh\Development\HabitMeasure

## TECH STACK
- Next.js 16 (App Router)
- TypeScript (strict — no `any`)
- Tailwind CSS
- Framer Motion (animations)
- Supabase (auth + database + waitlist)
- Vercel (deployment — auto-deploy on push to main)

## ROUTING
/ → Marketing landing page
/lab → Lab environment (beta testers only)
/beta → Beta signup page (invite code required)

## CODE RULES
- Read the codebase first — only change what is asked
- NEVER rewrite existing code — always copy and extend
- NEVER remove anything from existing files without explicit permission
- Add "use client" when using: useState, useEffect, onClick, Framer Motion, localStorage, window
- Use next/image for images, next/link for internal navigation
- Mobile-first. Every section must work on iPhone.
- No external images — CSS/SVG/Tailwind only for mockups
- Animations: smooth, not flashy
- Code and comments in English

## BRANCH & VERSIE
- Work directly on `main` — no dev branch
- Push to main → Vercel deploys automatically (~30 sec)
- Update `package.json` version at every task
- Versie: Patch (Z) per taak · Minor (Y) per feature-groep · Major (X) bij redesign

## VERSION MANAGEMENT (required at every task)

**Single source of truth:** the app semver lives only in [package.json](package.json) under `"version"`.

At the end of every task that ships a version bump:

1. Update `"version"` in `package.json` (semver: patch per small change, minor for feature groups, major for breaking redesigns).
2. Run `npm install` at the repo root so [package-lock.json](package-lock.json) root metadata (`version` and `packages[""].version`) stays aligned with `package.json`, then commit the lockfile if it changed.

**UI:** [app/components/VersionFooter.tsx](app/components/VersionFooter.tsx) imports `@/package.json` and displays `packageJson.version`. Do not add a second constants file for the same value.

**Do not** maintain `lib/version.ts` or `APP_VERSION` (removed; one source only).

## COMMIT FORMAAT
vX.Y.Z type(scope): Imperatieve beschrijving (Engels, geen punt, ≤50 tekens)

Types: feat ✨ | fix 🐛 | refactor ♻️ | chore 🔧 | style 🎨 | docs 📝 | perf ⚡

